{
  "node_id": "concept:physical-change",
  "title": "物理变化",
  "pattern_refs": ["pattern:concept-core"],
  "summary": "没有生成其他物质的变化，仅发生形态或形状的变化。",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "definition",
      "title": "定义",
      "content": [
        "虽然水和镁带都发生了形态或形状的变化，但没有生成其他物质，这样的变化属于物理变化。"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:lesson1-1-1-physical-change"]
    },
    {
      "id": "essence",
      "title": "本质理解",
      "content": [
        "物理变化的核心特征是不生成新物质。",
        "只是物质的形态、形状或状态发生改变。"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:lesson1-1-1-physical-change"]
    },
    {
      "id": "key-points",
      "title": "核心要点",
      "content": [
        "物理变化的本质特征：不生成新物质",
        "可能发生形态、形状、状态的改变"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:lesson1-1-1-physical-change"]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "典型例子",
      "content": [
        "水的沸腾：水由液态变为气态",
        "镁带剪断：镁带形状改变",
        "冰融化：固态水变为液态水"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:lesson1-1-1-physical-change"]
    },
    {
      "id": "non-examples",
      "title": "易混反例",
      "content": [
        "镁带燃烧：生成氧化镁，是化学变化",
        "铁丝燃烧：生成四氧化三铁，是化学变化"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:lesson1-1-1-chemical-change"]
    }
  ],
  "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:lesson1-1-1-physical-change"],
  "mention_refs": ["mention:chem-grade8-all-in-one:lesson1-1-1-physical-change"],
